    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder what it\u2019d be like to get isekai\u2019d with your unserious cousin and have to create new identities to survive in a world of magical and terrifying creatures? Follow the two cousins, Kam and Simon, as they laugh, cry, and stumble through a world they\u2019ve only imagined could be real in games and on TV.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of SclObonia is a turn-based fantasy RPG featuring dungeons, puzzles, and choice-based questlines. Level grind to your heart\u2019s content to upgrade skills, discover new techniques, and uncover the mysteries of a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squabble up as Simon, a brawler from the Woods of Ingle, as you swing first and ask questions never.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the world around you as Kam, as you learn to manipulate the arcane arts of SclObonia and take down your enemies (wits and a wand optional)!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder what it\u2019d be like to get isekai\u2019d with your unserious cousin and have to create new identities to survive in a world of magical and terrifying creatures? Follow the two cousins, Kam and Simon, as they laugh, cry, and stumble through a world they\u2019ve only imagined could be real in games and on TV.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of SclObonia is a turn-based fantasy RPG featuring dungeons, puzzles, and choice-based questlines. Level grind to your heart\u2019s content to upgrade skills, discover new techniques, and uncover the mysteries of a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squabble up as Simon, a brawler from the Woods of Ingle, as you swing first and ask questions never.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the world around you as Kam, as you learn to manipulate the arcane arts of SclObonia and take down your enemies (wits and a wand optional)!</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a turn-based RPG adventure with Kam and Simon who are summoned to the land of SclObonia. The two cousins must meet the inhabitants of the new-found land, unravel secrets long forgotten, and battle savage monsters and fathomless legions if they\u2019re to ever find a way back home.",
